flowchart LR
    accTitle: From source drift to a trusted release
    accDescr: Target-state governance flow. Detect changes in approved sources, map impact, propose evidence-linked updates, run checks, require human approval, publish a versioned release, monitor it, and retain rollback. Scheduled drift detection is not built yet and is marked as such.

    S[(Approved source registry)] --> D["Scheduled drift detection (not built yet)"]
    D --> I[Map affected claims, lessons, and checks]
    I --> P[Draft evidence-linked proposal]
    P --> E{Factuality, citation, and assessment checks pass?}
    E -->|No| P
    E -->|Yes| H{Human preview and approval}
    H -->|Revise| P
    H -->|Approve| R[Versioned release and audit record]
    R --> M[Monitor quality and freshness]
    M -->|Healthy| S
    M -->|Regression| B[Rollback with recorded reason]
    B --> S

